# The build context is this producer's own directory, and only its control
# templates are COPYed out of it. The copyright file lives in producers/radio
# and arrives through the `family` named context producer.env declares, so an
# edit to the driver, the README or a sibling producer cannot invalidate this
# producer's context.
#
# The unit body and the HCI-attach program are NOT here either. They arrive
# through the `radio-units` and `radio-hwinit` build contexts producer.env
# names, which point at the tree that ships them, so that this producer cannot
# become a second copy of files that must stay byte-identical.
*
!control/*.control
